+        "oversized mainly because of a `Conflicts with:` entry naming a SPLIT SIBLING "
+        "rather than organic new scope, that inherited size is not by itself a reason to "
+        "split again; treat it as a reason to build unless the brief's OWN new scope "
+        "independently justifies splitting.\n\n"
+    )
